para patayin si Propesor Ga Seon Yeong.

534
00:43:29.600 --> 00:43:31.200
Seung Hee.

535
00:43:35.133 --> 00:43:36.800
totoo ba yun?

536
00:43:37.600 --> 00:43:39.400
Susuriin ko.

537
00:43:49.733 --> 00:43:51.500
Hoy, Reporter Pyo. Anong meron?

538
00:43:51.500 --> 00:43:53.667
Oo, ako ito.

539
00:43:53.667 --> 00:43:55.633
Kasama mo ba si Kim Yeong Ran ngayon?

540
00:43:55.633 --> 00:43:58.967
<i>Pwede mo bang tanungin kung alam niya
may nagngangalang Kim Gyo Bong?</i>

541
00:43:59.767 --> 00:44:01.333
bakit naman

542
00:44:01.333 --> 00:44:03.600
Pinapasok na lang niya

543
00:44:03.600 --> 00:44:06.000
